    "Name": "King Crab KGC-011",
    "Details": "A Dark Age redesign of the King Crab, the KGC-011 is an unusual take on the classic assault mech. A 400-rated XXL Engine and a Supercharger make the KGC-011 the fastest King Crab to ever walk off of Cosara’s production line. A pair of LB-20X’s and a Plasma Rifle provide a devastating close range punch, whilst a Rocket Launcher acts as a backup weapon should an enemy survive to close in. \n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Command Mech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.18</color></b>",
